	"changelog": "\n    Version 2.2.0:\n    - Gemini and Hugging Face are now tried first for higher-quality, more\n      reliable results; the free g4f backend is off by default since it\n      relies on unofficial access to third-party services and can break\n      without notice (can be re-enabled in settings)\n    - Fixed: generated text no longer permanently overwrites your clipboard -\n      your previous clipboard contents are restored after every paste\n    - Fixed: all shortcuts are now guarded against being triggered twice at\n      once (e.g. pressing NVDA+Shift+H repeatedly while busy)\n    - Fixed: language auto-detection now matches whole words only, so\n      instructions like \"German engineering\" no longer force German output\n    - Fixed: error messages are now short and screen-reader friendly instead\n      of raw technical text\n    - Added: NVDA+Shift+X to cancel a generation in progress\n    - Added: NVDA+Shift+R to regenerate the last action\n    - Added: NVDA+Shift+Y to browse recent generation history\n    - Added: spoken preview of generated text (toggle in settings)\n    - Added: periodic progress tone during slow requests so NVDA doesn't\n      feel frozen\n    - Added: provider indicator shown with translation/refine/history results\n    - Added: tone and length can now be set inline in your instructions\n      (e.g. \"a short, friendly email about...\") in addition to language\n    - Added: editable per-content-type prompt templates in settings\n    - Added: settings now disclose that API keys are stored locally in\n      plain text\n\n    Version 2.1.0:\n    - Added Content Type selection (Email, Story, Blog, Message, Social, Poem, Essay, Report)\n    - NVDA+Shift+G: Generate title for any topic\n    - NVDA+Shift+H: Generate full content (stories, blogs, emails, etc.)\n    - Auto language detection (write \"in Marathi\" for Marathi output)\n    - Your Name field in settings (used for email signatures)\n    - Uses g4f (free AI) with provider rotation\n    - Works on any platform (WhatsApp, Telegram, Notepad, etc.)\n    - Fixed: Pollinations removed, using g4f with multiple providers\n    ",
	"licenseURL": "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html",
